{"slug":"jemele-hill-thelonious-brandon-scoop-b-robinson-aaron-nagler-social-media-erupts-after-a-now-deleted-tweet-by-the-source-about-dj-jazzy-jeff-watch","postId":75735,"title":"Jemele Hill, Thelonious Martin, Brandon 'Scoop B' Robinson, Aaron Nagler & Social Media Erupts After A Now Deleted Tweet By The Source Magazine About DJ Jazzy Jeff [Watch]","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hosting San Francisco's 49ers for the 2023 NFC Championship, the Philadelphia Eagles secured their fourth trip to the Super Bowl in franchise history.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During the half-time show, legendary DJ, DJ JAZZY JEFF performed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/rondarouseyszn/status/1619814493986648064?s=20u0026t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/rondarouseyszn/status/1619814493986648064?s=20&amp;t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After the Eagles beat the 49ers 31-7, Jeff was interviewed by CBS3 Philadelphia's Pat Gallen, and Philly legend said the Eagles are going to win it all. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"They are going to win it all... I'm going to be in Arizona. I might go to Arizona tomorrow,\" said Jeff.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/PatGallenCBS3/status/1619838319982186497?s=20u0026t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/PatGallenCBS3/status/1619838319982186497?s=20&amp;t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well after the game, the source magazine decided to tweet, \"Wait DJ Jazzy Jeff is a real DJ? Just thought that was just his title on The Fresh Prince Of Bel-Air.\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The platform would later delete the tweet, but only after it was captured by Bally Sports' Brandon 'Scoop B' Robinson and other social media members sounded off on the comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1619848400060690434?s=20u0026t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1619848400060690434?s=20&amp;t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Robinson also tweeted ' Pay your writers.\"  If you are not familiar with The Source Magazine, their has been numerous former writers and staff members, who have accused the platform of not paying them. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The ATLANTIC's Jemele Hill tweeted, \"We’re a deeply unserious society.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/jemelehill/status/1619844935871787009?s=20u0026t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/jemelehill/status/1619844935871787009?s=20&amp;t=rqg1u4VVPK7ywG73nsM-yw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Aaron Nagler who is the Co-Founder of Cheese Head TV tweeted, \"This can't be a real Tweet.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/AaronNagler/status/1619844798806134785?s=20u0026t=lY-wj1PzUgrH8kqIFYBBTw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/AaronNagler/status/1619844798806134785?s=20&amp;t=lY-wj1PzUgrH8kqIFYBBTw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>American record producer, Thelonious Martin tweeted, \"Which one of y’all interns is making y’all look like idiots on the lords day?\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/KingThelonious/status/1619842949109682176?s=20u0026t=BaasxHnZDgbbEGZyCZpn1A\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/KingThelonious/status/1619842949109682176?s=20&amp;t=BaasxHnZDgbbEGZyCZpn1A\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Washington Wizards And Mystics DJ, DJ Heat also chimed in, \"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If this is a troll tweet for a magazine that was once one of the go-to publications of hip-hop to tweet, this is corny. And if it’s not a troll, to not know the culture of what you’re supposed to report on is s*** emoji too.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/DJHeatDC/status/1619841189888532481?s=20u0026t=kHnTni4_xYRKFJMxufrDNQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/DJHeatDC/status/1619841189888532481?s=20&amp;t=kHnTni4_xYRKFJMxufrDNQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Speaking of DJ Jazzy Jeff,  he recently had his 58th birthday earlier this month. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Hosting San Francisco's 49ers for the 2023 NFC Championship, the Philadelphia Eagles secured their fourth trip to the Super Bowl in franchise history. During the half-time show, legendary DJ, DJ…","publishedAt":"2023-01-30T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2023-01-30T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"aaron-nagler","name":"Aaron Nagler"},{"slug":"bally-sports","name":"Bally Sports"},{"slug":"brandon-scoop-b-robinson","name":"Brandon &#039;Scoop B&#039; Robinson"},{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"cheese-head-tv","name":"Cheese Head TV"},{"slug":"dj-heat","name":"Dj Heat"},{"slug":"dj-jazzy-jeff","name":"DJ Jazzy Jeff"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"jemele-hill","name":"Jemele Hill"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"philadelphia-eagles","name":"Philadelphia Eagles"},{"slug":"san-francisco-49ers","name":"San Francisco 49ers"},{"slug":"the-atlantic","name":"The ATLANTIC"},{"slug":"the-source-magazine","name":"The Source Magazine"},{"slug":"thelonious-martin","name":"Thelonious Martin"}],"heroImage":null,"inlineImageUrls":[],"readingTimeMin":2,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/jemele-hill-thelonious-brandon-scoop-b-robinson-aaron-nagler-social-media-erupts-after-a-now-deleted-tweet-by-the-source-about-dj-jazzy-jeff-watch/"}